{"type":"standard","title":"Lauren Underwood","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lauren Underwood</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q48471874","titles":{"canonical":"Lauren_Underwood","normalized":"Lauren Underwood","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lauren Underwood</span></span>"},"pageid":58986352,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Lauren_Underwood_official_portrait.jpg/330px-Lauren_Underwood_official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/Lauren_Underwood_official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2803,"height":3504},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375299765","tid":"97c97d22-b22e-11f1-9094-19191afff4ef","timestamp":"2026-09-17T00:27:41Z","description":"American politician (born 1986)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Underwood","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Underwood?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Underwood?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lauren_Underwood"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Underwood","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Lauren_Underwood","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Underwood?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lauren_Underwood"}},"extract":"Lauren Ashley Underwood is an American politician and registered nurse who is a U.S. representative from Illinois's 14th congressional district as a member of the Democratic Party. Her district, once represented by former House speaker Dennis Hastert, includes the outer western suburbs of Chicago, including DeKalb, Joliet, Oswego, Ottawa, and Yorkville.","extract_html":"<p><b>Lauren Ashley Underwood</b> is an American politician and registered nurse who is a U.S. representative from Illinois's 14th congressional district as a member of the Democratic Party. Her district, once represented by former House speaker Dennis Hastert, includes the outer western suburbs of Chicago, including DeKalb, Joliet, Oswego, Ottawa, and Yorkville.</p>"}